{"unit_id":"angel291592__dsh-submodel#card-zh","repo":"angel291592/dsh-submodel","commit":"ae305b7c93501d4d0aebded46769e7eda0a58e8c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-submodel 是面向 DSH 的子代理委派策略插件，通过系统提示词和逐 agent 安装逻辑，为不同主模型设置默认委派方式，并提供统一的 delegate_task 入口。它支持 Flash 主模型继承当前路由、非 Flash 主模型使用配置的执行路由、显式专家路由，以及限制子代理继续派生任务。适合希望统一子任务分派规则和模型选择行为的 DSH 用户。非 Flash 默认路由需在 profile 配置中填写 provider 与 model。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:113","lib/delegation.js:148","lib/policy.js:154"]}
{"unit_id":"angel291592__dsh-submodel#card-en","repo":"angel291592/dsh-submodel","commit":"ae305b7c93501d4d0aebded46769e7eda0a58e8c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-submodel adds delegation policies and a delegate_task tool to DSH. Flash agents can inherit their current route; non-Flash agents can use a configured executor route. Child agents cannot delegate further. Configure provider and model for non-Flash delegation.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:113","lib/delegation.js:148","lib/policy.js:154"]}
