{"unit_id":"angel291592__dsh-submodel#feature-routing","repo":"angel291592/dsh-submodel","commit":"ae305b7c93501d4d0aebded46769e7eda0a58e8c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-submodel 的功能「按主模型选择委派策略」：根据当前模型区分 Flash 与非 Flash 路径，分别采用继承路由或 executor 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:113","lib/policy.js:277"]}
{"unit_id":"angel291592__dsh-submodel#feature-delegate","repo":"angel291592/dsh-submodel","commit":"ae305b7c93501d4d0aebded46769e7eda0a58e8c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-submodel 的功能「统一委派入口」：符合条件的顶层 agent 获得 delegate_task。它复用原生 subagent 的参数与输出定义，解析 provider/model 路由后通过宿主工具执行接口发起调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/delegation.js:130","lib/delegation.js:148"]}
{"unit_id":"angel291592__dsh-submodel#feature-guard","repo":"angel291592/dsh-submodel","commit":"ae305b7c93501d4d0aebded46769e7eda0a58e8c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-submodel 的功能「限制子代理继续委派」：子代执行工具时，guard 会阻止委派类工具及 subagent 前缀工具，并返回拒绝说明，要求子代把限制反馈给父代。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:236"]}
{"unit_id":"angel291592__dsh-submodel#feature-explicit-route","repo":"angel291592/dsh-submodel","commit":"ae305b7c93501d4d0aebded46769e7eda0a58e8c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-submodel 的功能「校验显式模型路由」：委派参数中的 provider 与 model 必须成对；非 Flash 主脑未配置 executor 路由时，未指定模型的委派会返回失败。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/policy.js:154"]}
{"unit_id":"angel291592__dsh-submodel#feature-lifecycle","repo":"angel291592/dsh-submodel","commit":"ae305b7c93501d4d0aebded46769e7eda0a58e8c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-submodel 的功能「按 agent 生命周期安装和卸载」：插件监听 agent 创建、释放、工具变化及步骤事件，按需安装 scoped 工具与提示词处理器，并在 agent 释放或组合变化时清理自身注册。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:113","lib/index.js:202"]}
